{"title":"오무라이스 잼잼","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=beMGu0/hAFPQHCOUa/R9PK4jNbjwtYqJQePYvEs1&filename=th3","synopsis":"'음식'과 '가족'의 이야기를 담은 에세이 만화.\n\n몇 개라도 먹을 수 있을 것 같은 '메추리알 조림',\n빙글빙글 돌아가는 '회전초밥',\n지구 반 바퀴 돌아 포르투갈에서 맛본 '에그타르트',\n매콤상콤하게 볶아 입맛 도는 '마라샹궈',\n짭짤한 밥도둑 '간장게장' 등\n\n우리가 사랑하는 모든 음식들에 얽힌\n흥미진진한 비화와 따스한 이야기가 펼쳐진다.\n\n엄마, 아빠, 딸, 그리고 아들로 구성된\n작가의 가족이 전하는 음식의 알찬 정보!\n\n몸과 정신의 영양까지 챙기는 건강한 작품, 지금 시작됩니다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":87,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":98,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":79,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":93,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":105,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":80,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":93,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":86,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":88,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":106,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":95,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":89,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":94,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":108,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":74,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":112,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":87,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":88,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":85,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":85,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","